    "aliases": ["Anthropic discrim-eval", "Explicit Discrimination", "Implicit Discrimination"],
    "description": "Tests whether a model’s yes/no decisions change with age, race, and gender across 70 hypothetical decision scenarios (loan approval, hiring, and similar). Explicit prompts state demographics; implicit prompts use names that imply race and gender. Each scenario has 135 demographic variants (9,450 prompts per split). Cards report mixed-effects discrimination coefficients; lower means less use of the demographic feature.",
    "summary": "Tests whether the model changes its yes/no decisions based on a person's age, race, or gender.",
